[00:19.98]Signs of the times are pointing to the Kingdom.
[00:24.16]Good news we tell for all to hear.
[00:29.01]Lift up your heads, and look to your salvation;
[00:33.86]Time for deliverance is near!
[00:37.89](Chorus)
[00:38.04]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[00:42.86]Sing loud, and raise a joyful cry.
[00:47.64]Rejoice in the hope, and show a grateful heart,
[00:52.60]All give praise and laud our God on high.
[00:57.23]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[01:02.12]His greatness all must come to know.
[01:06.92]With constant devotion to our God and King,
[01:11.77]Godly joy in service we will show.
[01:16.24]Look to our God, you lovers of Jehovah.
[01:31.44]No need to fear, for he is strong.
[01:36.16]Stand up and shout with voices loud as thunder;
[01:40.96]Sing to our God a joyful song!
[01:45.09](Chorus)
[01:45.24]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[01:50.10]Sing loud, and raise a joyful cry.
[01:54.44]Rejoice in the hope, and show a grateful heart,
[01:59.86]All give praise and laud our God on high.
[02:04.46]The joy of Jehovah is our stronghold.
[02:09.24]His greatness all must come to know.
[02:14.06]With constant devotion to our God and King,
